#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Die nodus het verander nadat die bladsy geteken is, so niks is gedoen nie. Hersien dit en probeer weer."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Jou toesteltoestemmings laat nie toe dat hierdie rekord gewysig word nie."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Naam: 'n ander fabric gebruik reeds hierdie naam."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Adapter: 'n ander fabric skandeer reeds hierdie adapterpoort op hierdie poller. Een fabric per adapterpoort."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Die fabric kon nie gestoor word nie."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "Die fabric is gestoor."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "'n Skandering van hierdie fabric loop tans, so niks is geskrap nie. Probeer weer wanneer dit klaar is."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Die fabric en sy inventaris is geskrap. Geen Cacti-toestel is verander nie en die fabric is nie gekontak nie."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Die fabric kon nie geskrap word nie."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Die nodusidentiteit is nie verander nie."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "Die nodusidentiteit is bygewerk. Dit word weer vanaf die volgende siklus geskandeer."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Die toestelkartering is na die nuwe nodus geskuif."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "Die voorstel kon nie bevestig word nie. Die nodusse het moontlik verander sedert dit gemaak is."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be rejected."
msgstr "Die voorstel kon nie verwerp word nie."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal was rejected."
msgstr "Die voorstel is verwerp."

