msgid "No device was created. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Geen toestel is geskep nie. Sien die Cacti-logboek."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device was created and the node mapped to it. Choose the ports to graph on the New Graphs page."
msgstr "Die toestel is geskep en die nodus is daaraan gekarteer. Kies die poorte vir grafieke op die Nuwe Grafieke-bladsy."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The inventory could not be read for export."
msgstr "Die inventaris kon nie vir uitvoer gelees word nie."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates and data query file were installed."
msgstr "Die Fabric-sjablone en datanavraaglêer is geïnstalleer."

#: fabric_health.php
