#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Fabric templates are not installed. Reinstall them from the health page."
msgstr "Die Fabric-sjablone is nie geïnstalleer nie. Herinstalleer hulle vanaf die gesondheidsbladsy."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Die nodus is reeds aan 'n toestel gekarteer."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Die nodus se fabric word nie deur die hoof-poller geskandeer nie, so sy toestel kon nie gepol word nie."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device does not exist."
msgstr "Die toestel bestaan nie."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device is polled by another poller than the one that sweeps this fabric, so it could not read the fabric cache."
msgstr "Die toestel word deur 'n ander poller gepol as die een wat hierdie fabric skandeer, so dit kon nie die fabric-kas lees nie."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, host name %s, polled by poller %d, with availability checks and SNMP off."
msgstr "'n Toestel \"%s\" vanaf die %s-toestelsjabloon, gasheernaam %s, gepol deur poller %d, met beskikbaarheidskontroles en SNMP af."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The %s data query on it, listing the node's ports. It creates no graph and no data source by itself."
msgstr "Die %s-datanavraag daarop, wat die nodus se poorte lys. Dit skep geen grafiek en geen databron op sigself nie."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Fabric plugin for node %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Geskep deur die Fabric-inprop vir nodus %s. Sy waardes kom uit die inpropkas; die gasheernaam is 'n gereserveerde naam wat nooit gekontak word nie."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, spaces, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Naam: gebruik 1 tot 64 letters, syfers, spasies, punte, koppeltekens of onderstrepe, en begin met 'n letter of syfer."

