#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Die skandering loop as root. Laat die poller loop as 'n onbevoorregte rekening met leestoegang tot die umad-toestelle deur middel van 'n groep."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "'n Diagnostiese hulpmiddel het die setuid- of setgid-bis. Die inprop het dit nooit nodig nie."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "'n Diagnostiese hulpmiddel of sy gids kan deur 'n ander rekening as sy eienaar, of deur die poller-rekening, geskryf word. Wie dit kan skryf, kies wat die poller uitvoer."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "'n umad-toestel is leesbaar of skryfbaar vir elke rekening, dus kan enige plaaslike gebruiker die fabric navraag doen. Beperk dit tot 'n groep."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Onbekende waarskuwing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Diagnostiese hulpmiddels"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Absolute gids, op elke poller wat 'n fabric skandeer, wat perfquery, ibnetdiscover en iblinkinfo bevat. Die Debian- en Ubuntu-pakkette installeer dit in /usr/sbin. Geen ander program word ooit daaruit uitgevoer nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Hulpmiddelgids"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Nodusnaamkaart"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Opsionele absolute pad na 'n infiniband-diags-nodusnaamkaartlêer. Name wat dit verskaf word slegs vertoon; identiteit is altyd die nodus-GUID."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Datagram-uitteltyd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Millisekondes wat elke bestuursdatagram mag neem voordat die hulpmiddels dit weer probeer (hul -t-opsie)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Opdrag-uitteltyd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een hulpmiddeluitvoering mag neem voordat dit gestop en as misluk aangeteken word."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB wat een hulpmiddeluitvoering mag druk. Groter afvoer word verwerp en as misluk aangeteken."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Maksimum afvoer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Skandering"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Nodus-tydbegroting"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een nodusskandering mag bestee aan die lees van tellers. Poorte wat nie bereik word nie, word in die volgende siklus gelees."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Mislukte poorte waarna 'n nodusskandering vir hierdie siklus stop. 'n Poort wat nie antwoord nie, kos etlike sekondes."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Nodus-mislukkingsbegroting"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Indekseer af-poorte"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, lys die Fabric Port-datanavraag ook poorte wat af is en geen afgeleë punt het nie, soos ongebruikte adapterpoorte. Wanneer ontmerk, word hulle uitgelaat totdat hulle opkom."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deïnstalleer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Behou inproptabelle by deïnstallasie"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, behou die deïnstallering van die inprop sy fabrics, inventaris en monsters. Ontmerk dit sodat die deïnstallering dit laat vaar; voer eers die inventaris uit vanaf die Fabric Admin-bladsy. Die fabric word in elk geval nooit gekontak nie."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Die hulpmiddelgids moet 'n absolute pad van letters, syfers, punte, koppeltekens, onderstrepe en skuinsstrepe wees, sonder 'n afsluitende skuinsstreep."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Die hulpmiddelgids bestaan nie of is nie 'n gids nie."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Die hulpmiddelgidspad bevat 'n simboliese skakel. Voer die werklike pad in."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Die hulpmiddelgids word nie deur root besit nie."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Die hulpmiddelgids kan deur sy groep of deur ander geskryf word."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "'n Diagnostiese hulpmiddel word nie deur root besit nie."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "'n Diagnostiese hulpmiddel kan deur sy groep of deur ander geskryf word."

